<p>
The volume of the region bounded by the hyperboloid of one sheet
<m>x^2+y^2-z^2=4</m> and the planes <m>z=3</m> and <m>z=-3</m>.
</p>
<sidebyside width="97%">
<image>
<latex-image>
\begin{tikzpicture}
\draw[rounded corners=8pt, draw=gray!55, thick] (0,0) rectangle (15,6);
\node[anchor=north west, text=gray!60, font=\footnotesize\itshape]
